.TH YAGI 1.SH NAMEyagi \- design a Yagi antenna.SH SYNOPSIS\fByagi\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONA Yagi-Uda antenna calculator, by DL6WU's method.  It asks five questionson its standard input -- the centre frequency in MHz, the number ofelements, the boom diameter, whether the elements are insulated from theboom (Y or N), and the tubing size, chosen from its own list -- and thenprints the length and position along the boom of every element.